"""
{{ $json.message || "(no message provided)" }}
"""

SCORING GUIDANCE
- fit_score (0-100): how well the account profile matches an ideal customer - seniority, company size, industry, budget signals.
- intent_score (0-100): how ready they are to buy now - explicit ask, urgency, timeline, evaluation language, specific use case.
- Treat vague one-liners, job seekers, students, vendors pitching us, and marketing spam as low intent; set spam_probability accordingly.
- Judge only from what is written. Do not invent facts about the company. Use "unknown" when a field is not evidenced.
- reasoning: two or three sentences a rep can read in five seconds.
- suggested_next_step: one concrete action, e.g. "Book a 20-min discovery call this week".

